components.note:
Reading a change in contributive AOV: a moving penetration means the category is in more or fewer orders (an inclusion question);
a moving category AOV means orders with the category spend more or less on it (a pricing or basket-size question).
Orders are counted per receipt, so they don't add up across categories: the total is all receipts, and its penetration is 100%. Net sales, items and contributive AOV add up.
